  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5602.05 Person Authorizing Another to Obtain their Record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5602.05 Person Authorizing Another to Obtain their Record. A person who wishes to grant permission to another person to obtain the motor vehicle record information shall complete form DSMV 505. Pursuant to RSA 260:14, VII, the form shall be notarized.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
